    {
      "id": "transfer.task.start",
      "state": "modeled",
      "summary": {
        "zh-cn": "首期有界运行要求用户在 Agent 内手动决定 Owner 审批，配置与身份版本绑定、原子一次消费；审批不冻结实时数据结构或所有业务值，当前 EA／Security／Provider 仍在执行时核验，受理不代表成功。",
        "en": "Initial bounded runs require a manual User owner decision in Agent, bind config and identity version, and consume once atomically. Approval does not freeze live schema or all values; current EA, Security and Provider checks still occur at execution, and admission is not success."
